# I

This niladic function returns a reference pointing to `→[*.Enumerations|DefMatIndices]` which is an enumration 
with all the data types available in `Input`.

There is a method `∆List` available that can be used to list the contents:

~~~
      GUI.Input.I.∆List
 ControlName  0
 Label        1
 Default      2
 DataType     3
 Length       4
 Active       5
 Column       6
~~~
